<title>UK: Commerzbank unit sets 400 mln DKR bond.</title>
<headline>Commerzbank unit sets 400 mln DKR bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers ABN AMRO Hoare Govett and BBL.</p>
<p> BORROWER   COMMERZBANK OVERSEAS FINANCE NV</p>
<p>GUARANTOR  COMMERZBANK AG</p>
<p> AMT    400 MLN DKR   COUPON     5.50	MATURITY    16.DEC.03</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.75    PAY DATE   L29.AUG.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AA2/AA-   DENOMS (K) 10-50     SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    LUX	 HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   STD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.625     SELL CONC  1.25	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	L LONG FIRST COUPON</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
